  attribute-CFG guidance scale.
- `run_pcf_eval.py` renamed `run_cf1_eval.py`, rewritten to depend only on the adapter
  contract, not `HDAELitModule`. Carried the in-flight PCF raw/corrected split through
  (now `CF1_raw`/`CF1_corr` etc.) — regression-checked bit-identical against the old
  `hier_k5` `pcf_aggregate.csv` by feeding its `pcf_per_intervention.csv` rows through the
  new aggregation code. Also fixed two latent bugs hit along the way: `save_frontier_plot()`
  reading the stale `FC_success` key, and the final log line reading a nonexistent
  `agg["micro_macro_gap"]` key (see experiments/hdae/AGENDA.md §8-9 for both).
  `guidance_scale` column replaced with generic `model_type`/`edit_strength` (HDAE's CFG
  scale isn't meaningful for other models — cross-model CSV comparability was the point).
- Acceptance test: `DiffAEProbeAdapter` (`diffae_adapter.py`) — a frozen, pretrained DiffAE
  (single z_sem, no hierarchy, linear-probe `z_sem + alpha*w` edit, no CFG) scored through
  the *exact same* `run_cf1_eval.py` entrypoint. Needed a real checkpoint: the archived
  `diffae_latent_probe/` wrapper targeted `ffhq256_autoenc`/a nonexistent `celeba64d2c_autoenc`
