**What landed this pass (MorphoMNIST++ dataset + causal graph only — explicit
instruction: "you should not change the models at all", so no HDAE integration, no
`data.dataset_name` dispatch, no ABLE/depth-ablation model — see `EXP_NOTES.md` for the
